  "about": "What build.ps1 puts beside the app as engine\\ for the EFI builder (windows/efibuild): python.org's embeddable Python and the packages Hardware Sniffer needs (wmi, which needs pywin32) and certifi, each downloaded once and checked by SHA-256 (the wheels' digests as PyPI publishes them; the Python zip's measured from python.org's file). The upstream trees (OpCore Simplify, Hardware Sniffer) are pinned in windows/efibuild/upstream/PINNED.json and checked file by file against their manifests. Nothing here is run on the machine that builds the release.",
